			<zone xml:id="p2z9-0" points="409,1229 657,1190 753,1198 794,1234 939,1193 1146,1206 1149,1100 957,1151 699,1115 665,1144 411,1154">426,1188 462,1191 498,1191 534,1190 570,1188 606,1188 642,1188 679,1186 715,1185 751,1185 787,1182 823,1180 859,1179 895,1178 932,1176 968,1173 1004,1171 1040,1168 1076,1167 1112,1166 1149,1164</zone>
